#: classes/wwpdf-compatibility.php:73
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<strong>Watermark PDF for WooCommerce</strong> requires WooCommerce to work. "
"You can <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">download "
"WooCommerce here</a>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Watermark PDF for WooCommerce</strong> requiere WooCommerce para "
"trabajar. Puedes <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">descargar "
"WooCommerce aquí</a>."

#: classes/wwpdf-compatibility.php:76
msgid ""
"The <strong>WC_Download_Handler</strong> WooCommerce class is missing! It is "
"required for the Watermark PDF plugin to work. Perhaps your WooCommerce "
"installation is corrupted?"
msgstr ""
"Falta la clase <strong>WC_Download_Handler</strong> WooCommerce Es necesaria "
"para que el plugin Watermark PDF funcione. Tal vez su instalación de "
"WooCommerce está dañada?"

#: classes/wwpdf-compatibility.php:79
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<strong>Watermark PDF for WooCommerce</strong> supports PHP %s or later. "
"Please update PHP on your server for better results."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Watermark PDF for WooCommerce</strong> es compatible con PHP %s o "
"posterior. Actualice PHP en su servidor para obtener mejores resultados."

#: classes/wwpdf-compatibility.php:82
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<strong>Watermark PDF for WooCommerce</strong> supports WordPress version %s "
"or later. Please update WordPress to use this plugin."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Watermark PDF for WooCommerce</strong> es compatible con la versión "
"de WordPress %s o posterior. Por favor, actualice WordPress para usar este "
"plugin."

#: classes/wwpdf-compatibility.php:85
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Sorry, <strong>Watermark PDF for WooCommerce</strong> supports WooCommerce "
"version %s or newer, for security reasons."
msgstr ""
"Lo sentimos, <strong>Watermark PDF for WooCommerce</strong> es compatible "
"con WooCommerce versión %s o posterior, por razones de seguridad."

#: classes/wwpdf-file-handler.php:72
msgid ""
"The free version of WaterMark PDF cannot serve PDFs from remote servers."
msgstr ""
"La versión gratuita de WaterMark PDF no puede servir PDFs desde servidores "
"remotos."

#: classes/wwpdf-file-handler.php:73
msgid ""
"Try uploading your PDF product to this domain using the native WooCommerce "
"file uploader."
msgstr ""
"Prueba a subir tu producto PDF a este dominio usando el cargador de archivos "
"nativo de WooCommerce."

